{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0449.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΤΟ ΕΝ ΑΒΥΣΣΑΙΟΝ ΥΔΩΡ ΕΝ ΤΩ ΑΡΙΘΜΩ ΔΕΙΚΝΥΕΙΝ ΕΘΕΛΟΥΣΑ."}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0449.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Η ΤΟΥΤΟΥ ΕΠΙΛΥΣΙΣ"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0449.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "10 ['] Ἕτεροι δὲ φασιν ὅτι πολυσύνθετόν ἐστιν τὸ ὕδωρ, ἀπὸ δύο μονάδων συνθέτων γινόμενον · ὡς πάντα (f. 120 v.) τὰ φυσικά τε καὶ τεχνικὰ πράγματα, πλοῖον, εἰ τύχοι, καὶ οἶκος, ὡς καὶ ὁ κόσμος εἰς ἐστιν τῷ ἀριθμῷ, ἐκ πολλῶν συνιστάμενος. Διὸ καὶ φησιν Ἑρμῆς ὅτι πολλὰ ὄντα ἓν λέγεται. Φάσκουσι δὲ καὶ τοῦτο πρὸς συνηγο- 15 ρίαν τοῦ λόγου τοῦ αὐτῶν οὕτως · « Τῷ ἀριθμῷ ἐν τριτῇ ἔχει τὴν σημασίαν · » λέγεται γὰρ ἐν τῷ ἀριθμῷ τὸ κατὰ συνέχειαν, ὡς τὸ δεκάπηχυ ξύλον, ὅπερ διὰ τὴν τῶν μορίων συνέχειαν ἓν ἐστι κατ' ἐνέργειαν, δυνάμει δὲ πλείονα, διὰ τὸ ἐπ' ἀπείρον ἐνδεχομένως τοῦτο διαιρετὸν λέγεται. Πάλιν ἐν τῷ ἀριθμῷ ὁμωνύμως ὡς ὁ ἄσ- 20 τρῶς κύων, καὶ ὁ θαλάσσιος, καὶ ὁ γεωργικός · μίαν γὰρ ἔχουσι"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "προσηγορίαν οἱ τρεῖς ὁμοίως ἐν τῷ ἀριθμῷ ἐστιν καὶ ὄνομα. Καὶ"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἔστιν τὸ ἀπλοῦν καὶ ἀσυνδύαστον, ὡς ἐν πνεῦμα, καὶ ψυχὴ μία,"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ἄγγελος εἷς."}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "2 Τὸ τοίνυν θειότατον ὕδωρ τῆς τέχνης, ὅπερ « ἀδύσταιον »"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καλεῖται παρὰ τοῦ διδασκάλου ἐν ἔστιν κατὰ συνέχειαν, σύνθετον"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐκ δύο μονάδων, καὶ οὐχ ἀπλοῦν ὅπερ οὐκ ἀγνοῶν ἔλεγεν ὁ"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἑρμῆς ὅτι, πολλὰ ὄντα, ἐν λέγεται, ὡς δυναμένον εἰς πλεῖονα τῷ εἴδει"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ τῷ ἀριθμῷ διαιρεῖσθαι, ὡς ὁ κόσμος εἷς ἐστιν. Καὶ οὐχὶ τούτοις"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐκ ἀκολουθεῖν χρῆν ἡμᾶς τοὺς ἐθελόντας μυστικῶς, καὶ οὐ μυθικῶς", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "διδάσκεσθαι τὴν ἀλήθειαν. Οὐ γὰρ οἷόν τε τὸ αὐτὸ ὕδωρ εἶναι", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ξανθὸν ἄμα καὶ λευχὸν καὶ μέλαν, ὥσπερ οὐδὲ τὸν αὐτὸν ἄνδρα"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "λευχὸν ἄμα καὶ μέλανα καὶ φαιόν, ἢ ἄλλο χρῶμα."}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "3 Ἄλλ’ οὐδὲ τὸ ἐν σύνθετον ἐνδέχεται, (f. 121 r.) πλεῖονά τε"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἄμα εἶναι καὶ ἐν ; Ἰδοὺ γὰρ ἄνθρωπος ἕκαστος, σύνθετος ὢν ἐκ"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ψυχῆς λογικῆς καὶ τοῦ σώματος, ἕνα τὸν ὁρισμὸν ἔχει καὶ οὐ πολλοὺς,", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὅθεν οὐ δύναται πλεῖον εἶς τε ἄμα καὶ εἷς ἢ γὰρ ἂν καὶ", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πλείονας ἔχει τοὺς ὁρισμοὺς, διότι ἕκαστη φύσις τὸν ἑαυτῆς ἐσώζεν"}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὁρισμόν. Εἰ γὰρ καὶ πλεῖονά εἰσιν τὰ μέρη τῶν συνθέτων, ὅθεν συνάγονται", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "philosophus-christianus.apori-e-n-bu-ssaion-u-dwr-e-n-tw-riqmw-deiknu-ein", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0450.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ἴσα καὶ δύνανται διαιρεῖσθαι πολλάκις. Ἄλλ’ ἕκαστον", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
